# Normalize line endings.
#
# The shell scripts and the systemd unit MUST check out with LF endings. A CRLF
# shebang line makes bash fail with "bad interpreter: No such file or directory",
# which on a fresh container looks like a broken installer rather than a line
# ending problem. Forcing LF here means a clone from a Windows working copy still
# deploys correctly.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh      text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.sql     text eol=lf
*.js      text eol=lf
*.css     text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
Caddyfile* text eol=lf

# Treat images as binary so they are never line-ending mangled.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
